            1. In HTMl writing JS (Bypassed by disabling JS while running in browser)
            2. Using HTML Attribute (Bypassed by calling Backend directly from Terminal or CURL from Terminal)
      --- As both can be Bypassed we always do Server-side Validation, for additional we keep Client-side Validation
      2. Server-Side Validation
            on Backend Code of PHP of .Dotnet
      In DotNEt
